   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the Financial Security Network and Improve Access to Financing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Este prstamo es la segunda operacin de una serie programtica de un programa basado en reformas de poltica. El objetivo de este programa es continuar promoviendo la estabilidad del sistema financiero ampliando el acceso al financiamiento.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This loan is the second operation in a policy-based programmatic series. Its objective is to continue to promote stability in the financial sector and to expand access to financing.</narrative>
  </description>
